# {{name}} — Next.js App

This is the **{{name}}** frontend application built with Next.js App Router.

## Structure

```
src/
├── app/           # Next.js App Router pages and layouts
├── features/      # Feature modules (self-contained)
│   └── <feature>/
│       ├── components/
│       ├── hooks/
│       ├── helpers/
│       ├── schemas/   # Zod validation
│       └── index.ts   # Barrel export
├── components/    # Shared app components
│   └── ui/        # shadcn/ui components
├── lib/           # Utilities and configuration
│   └── api/       # API client
└── hooks/         # Shared React hooks
```

## Rules

- Feature modules are self-contained with barrel exports
- Shared components go in `components/`, feature-specific in `features/<name>/components/`
- Max 250 lines per file
- Use `@/*` path alias for imports within this app
- Use `{{config.org}}/*` for shared package imports
